# Application Overview: OmniRoute Mobility Engine
Think of OmniRoute as the complete corporate transit and ride-hailing backend engine
(similar to Routmatic, Rapido, or Uber). It handles corporate shift bookings, pairs employees into shared cabs,
matches nearby drivers in real-time, tracks vehicles live on a map, and processes fare settlements automatically—backed by a smart AI safety assistant.

## 1. Executive Summary & Plain-English Overview
**OmniRoute** (`omniroute-mobility-backend`) is an enterprise-grade, real-time corporate transit, cab-pooling, and ride-hailing backend engine modeled after platforms like Routmatic, Rapido, and Uber. The platform manages the end-to-end lifecycle of corporate transit: authenticating employees and drivers, scheduling shift bookings, grouping riders into shared shuttles using graph algorithms, matching nearby drivers in sub-10ms intervals, streaming live GPS movement to mobile maps, settling corporate transit allowances via distributed event pipelines, and ensuring safety through an autonomous AI guardian.

